OL,3,GNEWSABaxters fish soup cans recalled
OL,4,Aover fears they could 'swell and
OL,5,Arupture'
OL,6,
OL,7,FCustomers who bought cans of a fish
OL,8,Fsoup manufactured by Baxters have been
OL,9,Furged to dispose of them in outside
OL,10,Fbins over fears the tins could burst.
OL,12,FThe firm has recalled its Chef
OL,13,FSelections Cullen Skink soup, a smoked
OL,14,Fhaddock chowder, due to a manufacturing
OL,15,Ffault which may cause it to spoil and
OL,16,Fcans to "swell and potentially
OL,17,Frupture", according to the Food
OL,18,FStandards Agency (FSA).
OL,20,FIf spoilt, the soup may have an
OL,21,F"unpleasant odour and flavour", the FSA
OL,22,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
