OL,3,GNEWSABaxters fish soup cans recalled
OL,4,Aover fears they could 'swell and
OL,5,Arupture'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe company, based in the north east of
OL,8,FScotland, said the issue may affect the
OL,9,F400g cans with batch code L07XC and an
OL,10,FApril 2029 best before date.
